  "short_description": "<p><span class=\"rnc2Gd\" data-ast-node-id=\"1\">Keep your food fresh and protected with a touch of authentic, sustainable Vietnamese craftsmanship. The </span><strong><span class=\"rnc2Gd\" data-ast-node-id=\"2\">Bamboo Food Tent</span></strong><span class=\"rnc2Gd\" data-ast-node-id=\"3\"> is the perfect blend of traditional artistry and modern, eco-conscious living.</span></p>",
  "description": "<p><br />\nHandcrafted for Protection and Style</p>\n<p>Made entirely in Vietnam, this food tent is a sustainable upgrade from plastic covers and flimsy mesh domes.</p>\n<p>Natural &amp; Sustainable: Expertly woven from 100% natural bamboo—a fast-growing, renewable resource that is lightweight yet incredibly durable.<br />\nArtisan Quality: Each tent is handwoven by Vietnamese artisans, whose weaving techniques ensure a tight, effective barrier against insects while allowing air circulation.<br />\nCharming Design: The natural color and unique, tightly-woven structure add a rustic, beautiful touch to any outdoor gathering, picnic, or kitchen counter.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Any Occasion</p>\n<p>Its functional design makes it a versatile tool for any home or outdoor event.</p>\n<p>Outdoor Dining: The essential accessory for your summer BBQs, picnics, and patio parties to keep pests away from your salads, fruit bowls, and baked goods.<br />\nKitchen Counter: Use it to cover rising dough, fresh bread, or produce.<br />\nEasy Storage: Lightweight and often designed to be easily stored or hung.</p>\n<p>Choose the Bamboo Food Tent for an attractive, effective, and environmentally responsible way to protect your food. You&#8217;re supporting sustainable craft and bringing a piece of Vietnamese tradition to your table.</p>",
